<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:36:09.128Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>CREATE CURSOR Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>CREATE CURSOR command</keyword>
    <keyword>SQL</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">CREATE CURSOR Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">创建一个临时表（游标），并将其打开在下一个可用的工作区中。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">CREATE CURSOR &lt;Alias&gt; ( &lt;FieldName&gt; &lt;FieldType&gt; [(&lt;nWidth&gt; [, &lt;nPrecision&gt;])] [NULL | NOT NULL] [AUTOINC [NEXTVALUE &lt;n1&gt;] [STEP &lt;n2&gt;]] [, ...] )<br/><br/>CREATE CURSOR &lt;Alias&gt; FROM ARRAY &lt;ArrayName&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;Alias&gt;<tab />游标的别名。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;FieldName&gt; &lt;FieldType&gt;<tab />游标的字段。有关字段类型和字段子句的说明，请参阅 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_CREATE_TABLE">CREATE TABLE</link>。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">FROM ARRAY &lt;ArrayName&gt;<tab />从结构数组（例如 AFields() 返回的数组）创建游标。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">游标是一个以独占方式打开并标记为临时表的普通表。关闭游标时，该文件将被删除。游标绝不会成为数据库的一部分。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_CREATE_TABLE">CREATE TABLE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_USE_FoxPro">USE (FoxPro)</link></para>
  </body>
